      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "**Total Sales by Each Store:**\n",
        "\n",
        "This analysis calculates the total sales generated by each store and ranks the stores from highest to lowest based on overall sales performance.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "jDZWy7LmTIgV"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "pd.read_sql_query(\"\"\"\n",
        "SELECT Store, SUM(Weekly_Sales) AS Total_Sales, RANK() OVER (ORDER BY SUM(Weekly_Sales) DESC) AS Sales_Rank\n",
        "FROM walmart_sales\n",
        "GROUP BY Store\n",
        "ORDER BY Sales_Rank;\n",
        "\"\"\",conn)"
      ],
