      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Which Months Have the Highest Average Weekly Sales?**\n",
        "\n",
        "This analysis compares average weekly sales by month to identify seasonal patterns and determine which months tend to generate stronger weekly sales performance."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qIOi7XzjIoDL"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "pd.read_sql_query(\"\"\"\n",
        "SELECT\n",
        "    strftime('%m', Date) AS Month_Number,\n",
        "    AVG(Weekly_Sales) AS Avg_Weekly_Sales,\n",
        "    COUNT(*) AS Observations\n",
        "FROM walmart_sales\n",
        "GROUP BY Month_Number\n",
        "ORDER BY Avg_Weekly_Sales DESC;\n",
        "\n",
        "\"\"\", conn)"
